                ><span class="readout" id="sc-codex-count">0 of {PERKS.length}</span> found</span
              >
            </h3>
            <p class="panel-intro">
              Every perk you have found, across every run. Resetting the experiment keeps it; only
              the top-bar reset clears it.
            </p>
